---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Intro from '../components/Intro.astro';
import { company } from '../data/company';
---

<Layout title="Privacy & data use"
  ><Intro
    eyebrow="PRIVACY & DATA USE"
    title="Your information, handled with care."
    description="How information is used when you browse this website or contact Monir Group."
  /><section class="section">
    <div class="wrap article">
      <p class="small muted">Updated 29 September 2026</p><h2>
        Preparing an inquiry
      </h2><p>
        The inquiry form prepares a message using the contact details and
        requirements you enter. The website does not automatically send the
        message or save these details in a database or browser storage.
        Reloading or closing the page clears your form entries.
      </p><p>
        When you choose WhatsApp or email, your prepared message is passed to
        that service or application. You must press Send there to deliver it to
        Monir Group. WhatsApp and your email provider process information under
        their own privacy policies.
      </p><h2>Information you send to Monir Group</h2><p>
        Our team uses information you send to understand your requirements,
        respond to questions and discuss products, quotations and related
        business arrangements. Please include only the information needed for
        your inquiry. Do not include payment card details, passwords or
        sensitive identity documents.
      </p><p>
        To ask about information you have shared, request a correction or
        request deletion, contact <a href={`mailto:${company.email.value}`}
          >{company.email.value}</a
        >. Information needed for ongoing transactions or legal obligations may
        need to be retained.
      </p><h2>Website links and hosting</h2><p>
        A selected product may appear in the page URL to help you open a
        product-specific inquiry. Avoid entering personal or confidential
        information in the product field or sharing links containing it.
      </p><p>
        This website is hosted through OpenAI Sites on Cloudflare
        infrastructure. Hosting and access providers may process ordinary
        connection and access logs. No advertising cookies or third-party
        analytics service has been added to this website.
      </p><p>
        Maps, WhatsApp, phone and email links open external services or
        applications. Their own privacy practices apply when you use them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section></Layout
>
